@host = http://localhost:5007

### Проверка работы API
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Регистрация нового пользователя
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Admin"
}

###

### Повторная регистрация с тем же email
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "ADMIN@example.com",
  "password": "qwerty",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Admin"
}